 "notes": "Starting three or more games at once crashed the launcher, taking the games inside it down too. Games now start one after another, and the launcher records what happens so any crash left can be tracked down.\n\nFixed\n- Starting several games together crashed Golem Launcher right after the third one went inside (all three were loading at the same moment). Now each game starts once the one before has finished loading. Play all and pressing Play on several games both wait their turn\n\nChanged\n- Games waiting their turn show \"Waiting\" instead of \"Starting\"",
